
% Cruise

In_hook: I | V | vi | IV |
In_instr: I | V | vi | IV |
a: I | V | vi | IV |
link: I | V | vi | IV |
a_cad: I | V | vi | R |
Vr: $a $a_cad
Ch: $a*4
instr: $a*2
link_2: $a*2
Ch_short: $a*2
outro: $a*2
a_turnaround: I | V | vi | IV |
bridge: $a $a_turnaround
ending: I |
S: [B] $In_hook $In_instr $Vr $Ch $link $Vr $Ch $instr $bridge $link_2 $Ch_short $Ch $outro $ending
